users/tiwilliam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-28T09:32:33Z","updated_at":"2022-03-28T09:38:24Z","body":"I noticed that this only seems to be a problem after issuing a `session.refresh` or `session.expire`. The criteria will be added fine if the object is queried fresh.\r\n\r\nPassing test case showing this:\r\n```py\r\ndef test_children_lazy_joined_after_refresh(self):\r\n    parent = Parent(id=1)\r\n    child1 = Child(id=1, parent_id=1)\r\n    child2 = Child(id=2, parent_id=1)\r\n\r\n    session.add_all([parent, child1, child2])\r\n    session.flush()\r\n\r\n    child1.delete()\r\n\r\n    parent_with_deleted_child = session.query(Parent).filter_by(id=1).one_or_none()\r\n    assert parent_with_deleted_child.children_lazy_joined == [child2]\r\n\r\n    session.refresh(parent_with_deleted_child)\r\n    assert parent_with_deleted_child.children_lazy_joined == [child1, child2]\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/1080417209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"tiwilliam","id":190349,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDM0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/tiwilliam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tiwilliam/followers","following_ur